able for everyday cooking">produces a milder oil suitable for everyday cooking</span>.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="1197" data-end="1217"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="12_Black_Sesame"></span>1.2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="Black Sesame">Black Sesame</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="1218" data-end="1642"><li class="" data-start="1218" data-end="1274"><p class="" data-start="1220" data-end="1274"><strong data-start="1220" data-end="1231">Источник:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="Found in China">Found in China</span>, Индия, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="and Southeast Asia">and Southeast Asia</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1275" data-end="1333"><p class="" data-start="1277" data-end="1333"><strong data-start="1277" data-end="1292">Появление:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Dark">Dark</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="small seeds with concentrated oil">small seeds with concentrated oil</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1334" data-end="1402"><p class="" data-start="1336" data-end="1402"><strong data-start="1336" data-end="1352"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="Oil Content">Oil Content</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Slightly lower than white sesame">Slightly lower than white sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="around 40%–45%">around 40%–45%</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1403" data-end="1510"><p class="" data-start="1405" data-end="1510"><strong data-start="1405" data-end="1419">Питание:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Contains high levels of polyphenols and vitamin E">Contains high levels of polyphenols and vitamin E</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="offering strong antioxidant properties">o