="2940" data-end="3033"><em data-start="2940" data-end="2958">Характеристики:</em> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="Intense aroma and flavor">Intense aroma and flavor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="which can quickly elevate the taste of dishes">which can quickly elevate the taste of dishes</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="3036" data-end="3131"><p class="" data-start="3038" data-end="3131"><em data-start="3038" data-end="3046">Использование:</em> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="Commonly used in dipping sauces">Commonly used in dipping sauces</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="dressings">dressings</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="and as a finishing oil in Asian cuisine">and as a finishing oil in Asian cuisine</span>.</p></li></ul></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="3133" data-end="3136" /><h2 class="" data-start="3138" data-end="3195"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_How_Does_Sesame_Oil_Go_Bad_The_Spoilage_Mechanisms"></span>3. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="How Does Sesame Oil Go Bad">How Does Sesame Oil Go Bad</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="The Spoilage Mechanisms">The Spoilage Mechanisms</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="3197" data-end="3294"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame oil">Sesame oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="like all edible oils">like all edible oils</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="is subject to spoilage over time">is subject to spoilage over time</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Here are the primary factors">Here are the primary factors</span>:</p><h3 class="" data-start="3296" data-end="3320"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="31_Chemical_Changes"></span>3.1 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="Chemical Changes">Chemical Changes</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3321" data-end="3774"><li class="" data-start="3321" data-end="3537"><p class="" data-start="3323" data-end="3537"><strong data-start="3323" data-end="3348"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="Fatty Acid Oxidation">Fatty Acid Oxidation</span>:</strong><br data-start="3348" data-end="3351" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame oil is rich in unsaturated fatty acids">Sesame oil is rich in unsaturated fatty acids</span> (НАПРИМЕР., <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="linoleic acid">linoleic acid</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="that react with oxygen">that react with oxygen</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="This oxidation produces peroxides">This oxidation produces peroxides</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="aldehydes">aldehydes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="and other compounds responsible for rancidity">and other compounds responsible for rancidity</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="3541" data-end="3774"><p class="" data-start="3543" data-end="3774"><strong data-start="3543" data-end="3581"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="Depletion of Natural Antioxidants">Depletion of Natural Antioxidants</span>:</strong><br data-start="3581" data-end="3584" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="Compounds like sesamol and sesamin in sesame oil act as natural antioxidants">Compounds like sesamol and sesamin in sesame oil act as natural antioxidants</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="Over time">Over time</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="exposure to air and light depletes these antioxidants">exposure to air and light depletes these antioxidants</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="making the oil more vulnerable to oxidation">making the oil more vulnerable to oxidation</span>.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="3776" data-end="3802"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="32_Storage_Conditions"></span>3.2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="Storage Conditions">Storage Conditions</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3803" data-end="4259"><li class="" data-start="3803" data-end="3931"><p class="" data-start="3805" data-end="3931"><strong data-start="3805" data-end="3824"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="Light Exposure">Light Exposure</span>:</strong><br data-start="3824" data-end="3827" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="Light">Light</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="especially UV rays">especially UV rays</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="can catalyze the oxidation process">can catalyze the oxidation process</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="causing the oil to develop off-flavors">causing the oil to develop off-flavors</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="3935" data-end="4111"><p class="" data-start="3937" data-end="4111"><strong data-start="3937" data-end="3953">Температура:</strong><br data-start="3953" data-end="3956" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="High temperatures accelerate chemical reactions">High temperatures accelerate chemical reactions</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame oil stored at room temperature or higher will degrade faster than oil kept in a cool environment">Sesame oil stored at room temperature or higher will degrade faster than oil kept in a cool environment</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4115" data-end="4259"><p class="" data-start="4117" data-end="4259"><strong data-start="4117" data-end="4134"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="Air Exposure">Air Exposure</span>:</strong><br data-start="4134" data-end="4137" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="Once opened">Once opened</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="the increased contact with oxygen speeds up spoilage">the increased contact with oxygen speeds up spoilage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="particularly if the container is not properly sealed">particularly if the container is not properly sealed</span>.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="4261" data-end="4290"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="33_Environmental_Factors"></span>3.3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="Environmental Factors">Environmental Factors</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4291" data-end="4586"><li class="" data-start="4291" data-end="4423"><p class="" data-start="4293" data-end="4423"><strong data-start="4293" data-end="4306"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="Humidity">Humidity</span>:</strong><br data-start="4306" data-end="4309" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="Moisture can indirectly affect oil quality by promoting microbial growth or affecting the container’s integrity">Moisture can indirectly affect oil quality by promoting microbial growth or affecting the container’s integrity</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4427" data-end="4586"><p class="" data-start="4429" data-end="4586"><strong data-start="4429" data-end="4452"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="Container Material">Container Material</span>:</strong><br data-start="4452" data-end="4455" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="Transparent containers allow more light penetration">Transparent containers allow more light penetration</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="while metal containers may trigger chemical reactions if not properly lined">while metal containers may trigger chemical reactions if not properly lined</span>.</p></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="4588" data-end="4591" /><h2 data-start="4593" data-end="4658"><img src="/images/white-sesame-oil-300x270.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone  wp-image-983" alt="white sesame oil" width="593" height="534" title="Имеет ли кунжутное масло срок годности? Разновидности, Механизмы порчи, и советы по хранению 5" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_237" data-source="" data-orig="white sesame oil" data-hidden="y"></span></h2><h2 class="" data-start="4593" data-end="4658"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Why_Does_Sesame_Oil_Spoil_Types_and_Speed_of_Deterioration"></span>4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="Why Does Sesame Oil Spoil">Why Does Sesame Oil Spoil</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="Types and Speed of Deterioration">Types and Speed of Deterioration</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 class="" data-start="4660" data-end="4686"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="41_Causes_of_Spoilage"></span>4.1 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="Causes of Spoilage">Causes of Spoilage</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4687" data-end="5090"><li class="" data-start="4687" data-end="4899"><p class="" data-start="4689" data-end="4899"><strong data-start="4689" data-end="4703"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="Rancidity">Rancidity</span>:</strong><br data-start="4703" data-end="4706" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="The primary form of spoilage is rancidity">The primary form of spoilage is rancidity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="where oxidation leads to the formation of free radicals and peroxides">where oxidation leads to the formation of free radicals and peroxides</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="This not only alters the flavor and aroma but also reduces nutritional value">This not only alters the flavor and aroma but also reduces nutritional value</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4903" data-end="5090"><p class="" data-start="4905" data-end="5090"><strong data-start="4905" data-end="4933"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_145" data-source="" data-orig="Microbial Contamination">Microbial Contamination</span>:</strong><br data-start="4933" data-end="4936" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="In less ideal storage conditions">In less ideal storage conditions</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="high humidity">high humidity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="poor hygiene">poor hygiene</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="microbial contamination">microbial contamination</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="molds or bacteria">molds or bacteria</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="can occur">can occur</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="leading to further deterioration">leading to further deterioration</span>.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="5092" data-end="5129"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="42_Spoilage_Conditions_and_Speed"></span>4.2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="Spoilage Conditions and Speed">Spoilage Conditions and Speed</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="5130" data-end="5435"><li class="" data-start="5130" data-end="5265"><p class="" data-start="5132" data-end="5265"><strong data-start="5132" data-end="5155"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="Optimal Conditions">Optimal Conditions</span>:</strong><br data-start="5155" data-end="5158" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="Under ideal storage">Under ideal storage</span> (прохладный, <span class ="t