 id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="and potentially contribute to cardiovascular disease over time">and potentially contribute to cardiovascular disease over time</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="5656" data-end="5815"><p class="" data-start="5658" data-end="5815"><strong data-start="5658" data-end="5679"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="Microbial Toxins">Microbial Toxins</span>:</strong><br data-start="5679" data-end="5682" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="If microbial contamination occurs">If microbial contamination occurs</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="there is a risk of ingesting toxins that can lead to food poisoning or long-term health effects">there is a risk of ingesting toxins that can lead to food poisoning or long-term health effects</span>.</p></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="5817" data-end="5820" /><h2 class="" data-start="5822" data-end="5884"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Storage_Recommendations_A_%E2%80%9CHow_To%E2%80%9D_Guide_for_Sesame_Oil"></span>5. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="Storage Recommendations">Storage Recommendations</span>: А &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="How To">How To</span>&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="Guide for Sesame Oil">Guide for Sesame Oil</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="5886" data-end="6024"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="Proper storage can extend the life of sesame oil and preserve its quality">Proper storage can extend the life of sesame oil and preserve its quality</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="Here are tailored recommendations based on the sesame oil type">Here are tailored recommendations based on the sesame oil type</span>:</p><h3 class="" data-start="6026" data-end="6072"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="51_General_Storage_Tips_All_Sesame_Oils"></span>5.1 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="General Storage Tips">General Storage Tips</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="All Sesame Oils">All Sesame Oils</span>)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="6073" data-end="6418"><li class="" data-start="6073" data-end="6211"><p class="" data-start="6075" data-end="6211"><strong data-start="6075" data-end="6092"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="Keep It Cool">Keep It Cool</span>:</strong><br data-start="6092" data-end="6095" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="Store sesame oil in a cool">Store sesame oil in a cool</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="dry place—preferably below 20°C">dry place—preferably below 20°C</span> (68<span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="°F">°F</span>). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="For long-term storage">For long-term storage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="refrigeration is ideal">refrigeration is ideal</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="6215" data-end="6319"><p class="" data-start="6217" data-end="6319"><strong data-start="6217" data-end="6233"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid Light">Avoid Light</span>:</strong><br data-start="6233" data-end="6236" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="Use dark-colored glass bottles or opaque containers to shield the oil from light">Use dark-colored glass bottles or opaque containers to shield the oil from light</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="6323" data-end="6418"><p class="" data-start="6325" data-end="6418"><strong data-start="6325" data-end="6342"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="Seal Tightly">Seal Tightly</span>:</strong><br data-start="6342" data-end="6345" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="Always close the bottle immediately after use to minimize air exposure">Always close the bottle immediately after use to minimize air exposure</span>.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="6420" data-end="6448"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="52_For_White_Sesame_Oil"></span>5.2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="For White Sesame Oil">For White Sesame Oil</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="6449" data-end="6730"><li class="" data-start="6449" data-end="6555"><p class="" data-start="6451" data-end="6555"><strong data-start="6451" data-end="6468"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="Everyday Use">Everyday Use</span>:</strong><br data-start="6468" data-end="6471" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="Store in a pantry or kitchen cabinet away from the stove and other heat sources">Store in a pantry or kitchen cabinet away from the stove and other heat sources</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="6556" data-end="6730"><p class="" data-start="6558" data-end="6730"><strong data-start="6558" data-end="6580"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="Long-Term Storage">Long-Term Storage</span>:</strong><br data-start="6580" data-end="6583" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="If you do not use the oil frequently">If you do not use the oil frequently</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="consider refrigerating it and allowing it to return to room temperature before cooking to avoid cloudiness">consider refrigerating it and allowing it to return to room temperature before cooking to avoid cloudiness</span>.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="6732" data-end="6783"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="53_For_Black_Sesame_Oil_and_Roasted_Sesame_Oil"></span>5.3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="For Black Sesame Oil and Roasted Sesame Oil">For Black Sesame Oil and Roasted Sesame Oil</span><span class="ez-toc-sec