h day</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_217" data-source="" data-orig="minimizing air exposure and preserving the oil’s potent aroma and nutritional value">minimizing air exposure and preserving the oil’s potent aroma and nutritional value</span>.</p></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="7726" data-end="7729" /><h2 class="" data-start="7731" data-end="7747"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Summary"></span>6. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_218" data-source="" data-orig="Summary">Summary</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="7749" data-end="8292"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_219" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame oil does indeed expire">Sesame oil does indeed expire</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_220" data-source="" data-orig="but its shelf life can be significantly extended with proper handling and storage">but its shelf life can be significantly extended with proper handling and storage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_221" data-source="" data-orig="By understanding the differences among sesame varieties">By understanding the differences among sesame varieties</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_222" data-source="" data-orig="the mechanisms behind oil spoilage">the mechanisms behind oil spoilage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_223" data-source="" data-orig="and the potential health risks associated with consuming rancid oil">and the potential health risks associated with consuming rancid oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_224" data-source="" data-orig="consumers can make informed choices">consumers can make informed choices</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_225" data-source="" data-orig="Whether you’re using white sesame oil for everyday cooking or a robust black or roasted sesame oil for gourmet recipes">Whether you’re using white sesame oil for everyday cooking or a robust black or roasted sesame oil for gourmet recipes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_226" data-source="" data-orig="following the storage tips provided will help maintain its flavor">following the storage tips provided will help maintain its flavor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_227" data-source="" data-orig="nutritional integrity">nutritional integrity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_228" data-source="" data-orig="and overall quality">and overall quality</span>.</p><hr class="" data-start="8294" data-end="8297" /><h2 class="" data-start="8299" data-end="8311"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Citations"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_229" data-source="" data-orig="Citations">Citations</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul data-start="8312" data-end="8661"><li class="" data-start="8312" data-end="8436"><p class="" data-start="8314" data-end="8436"><em data-start="8352" data-end="8377"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_230" data-source="" data-orig="Journal of Food Science">Journal of Food Science</span></em>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_231" data-source="" data-orig="Comparative analysis of sesame varieties and oil content">Comparative analysis of sesame varieties and oil content</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="8437" data-end="8542"><p class="" data-start="8439" data-end="8542"><em data-start="8477" data-end="8493"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_232" data-source="" data-orig="Food Chemistry">Food Chemistry</span></em>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_233" data-source="" data-orig="Studies on fatty acid oxidation in edible oils">Studies on fatty acid oxidation in edible oils</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="8543" data-end="8661"><p class="" data-start="8545" data-end="8661"><em data-start="8583" data-end="8611"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_234" data-source="" data-orig="FDA Nutritional Guidelines">FDA Nutritional Guidelines</span></em>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_235" data-source="" data-orig="Information on oxidized lipids and health risks">Information on oxidized lipids and health risks</span>.</p></li></ul>`} />
